{
  "id": "working-hours",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Create and assign working hours",
  "lang": "en",
  "app_version": "preprod-2026-10-11",
  "viewport": {
    "width": 1920,
    "height": 1080
  },
  "start": {
    "url": "https://app-pre-production.sloneek.com/app/dashboard-v2",
    "local_storage": {
      "local-translate": "en"
    }
  },
  "voice": {
    "provider": "external",
    "voice_id": "7jQ3jNk3Fcw65sWUmzun",
    "model_id": "eleven_v4"
  },
  "chapters": true,
  "interstitials": true,
  "thumbnail": {
    "shot": "s16",
    "title": "Working hours"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "narration": "How many hours a week should each person work? Hi, I'm Maria from the Sloneek team, and I'll show you how to create and assign working hours.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_other_settings",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_other_settings",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      },
      "part": 1,
      "part_title": "Introduction",
      "hold_after_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "narration": "Working hours, called a work contract in the app, define when someone is supposed to work. Without them, a person can't take absences or record attendance.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_other_settings",
          "before_ms": 1500
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_other_settings",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_other_settings",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "narration": "In the left menu, I open Settings. You'll find working hours in the Work contracts setup row.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_other_settings",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] slnk-sloneek-settings-dashboard-row:has-text(\"Work contracts setup\")",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] slnk-sloneek-settings-dashboard-row:has-text(\"Work contracts setup\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] slnk-sloneek-settings-dashboard-row:has-text(\"Work contracts setup\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/settings/dashboard"
      },
      "part": 2,
      "part_title": "Where to find them",
      "voice_after_actions": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "narration": "When I open it, you see the list of templates: whether they're active, whether they're weekly or annual, and their note.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] slnk-sloneek-settings-dashboard-row:has-text(\"Work contracts setup\") >> a[href=\"/app/settings/working-hours\"]",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-center-cols-container .ag-row[row-index=\"0\"]",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-header",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #settings_working_hours_add_working_hours_button",
        "url_contains": "/app/settings/working-hours"
      },
      "voice_after_actions": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "narration": "I create a new template with the Add button. The New work contract type form opens.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #settings_working_hours_add_working_hours_button",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #settings_working_hours_add_working_hours_button",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] input[formcontrolname=name]",
          "value": "15000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #settings_working_hours_form_save_new_button",
        "url_contains": "/working-hours/setup"
      },
      "part": 3,
      "part_title": "New template"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "narration": "You can start from a predefined template, such as Full Time or Half Time. But I'll start from scratch.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] input[placeholder=\"Select a predefined template\"]",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "slnk-common-autocomplete-option-list",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-common-autocomplete-option-list",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1200"
        },
        {
          "type": "press",
          "value": "Escape",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] input[formcontrolname=name]",
        "url_contains": "/working-hours/setup"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "narration": "In the Name field, I type Part-time, 30 hours. I enter the same text in the English translation, too.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] input[formcontrolname=name]",
          "value": "Part-time 30 h",
          "clear": true,
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=translatedNameInput]",
          "value": "Part-time 30 h",
          "clear": true,
          "before_ms": 500,
          "speed": "fast"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=translatedNameInput]",
        "url_contains": "/working-hours/setup"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "narration": "In the note, I briefly describe who the template is for. I leave the Active switch on, so the template can be used.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "fill",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] textarea[formcontrolname=note]",
          "value": "Monday to Friday, 6 hours a day.",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] nb-toggle[formcontrolname=is_enabled]",
          "before_ms": 600
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] nb-toggle[formcontrolname=is_enabled]",
        "url_contains": "/working-hours/setup"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "narration": "A work contract can be weekly or annual. A weekly schedule repeats every week and suits regular work.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] nb-select[formcontrolname=type] button",
          "before_ms": 800
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "nb-option:text-is(\"Weekly\")",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "nb-option:text-is(\"Weekly\")",
          "before_ms": 600
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "nb-option:text-is(\"Annual\")",
        "url_contains": "/working-hours/setup"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "narration": "An annual schedule is set for each day of the year separately, for example for shifts. I'll keep Weekly.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "nb-option:text-is(\"Annual\")",
          "before_ms": 800
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1800"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-option:text-is(\"Weekly\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "400"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] nb-select[formcontrolname=type] button:has-text(\"Weekly\")",
        "url_contains": "/working-hours/setup"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "narration": "I've saved the template. Below the form, a new table has appeared for the weekly working hours setting.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #settings_working_hours_form_save_new_button",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #settings_working_hours_form_save_new_button",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-center-cols-container .ag-row[row-index=\"6\"]",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "scroll",
          "value": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] span:has-text(\"Weekly working hours fund\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] nb-card:has-text(\"Weekly working hours setting\") >> nb-card-header",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] span:has-text(\"Weekly working hours fund\")",
        "url_contains": "/working-hours/setup/"
      },
      "voice_after_actions": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "narration": "Sloneek has pre-filled a standard week: Monday to Friday, nine to five-thirty, with a thirty-minute break. The weekly fund is forty hours.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-body-viewport",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] span:has-text(\"Weekly working hours fund\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] span:has-text(\"Weekly working hours fund\"):has-text(\"40:00\")",
        "url_contains": "/working-hours/setup/"
      },
      "part": 4,
      "part_title": "Weekly schedule"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "narration": "The Reset button clears the table, and Normal brings back exactly this standard week.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:text-is(\"Reset\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "900"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:text-is(\"Normal\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:text-is(\"Copy the first line\")",
        "url_contains": "/working-hours/setup/"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "narration": "For a part-time contract, I change the End of working hours in Monday's row to three-thirty.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "fill",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-center-cols-container .ag-row[row-index=\"0\"] .ag-cell[col-id=shift_end] input",
          "value": "15:30",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "300"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] span:has-text(\"Weekly working hours fund\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] span:has-text(\"Weekly working hours fund\"):has-text(\"38:00\")",
        "url_contains": "/working-hours/setup/"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "narration": "With Copy the first line, I copy Monday's times to the whole week.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:text-is(\"Copy the first line\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:text-is(\"Copy the first line\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] span:has-text(\"Weekly working hours fund\"):has-text(\"42:00\")",
        "url_contains": "/working-hours/setup/"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "narration": "The copy also went to the weekend, so for Saturday and Sunday, I untick Workday. The fund now shows thirty hours.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-center-cols-container .ag-row[row-index=\"5\"] .ag-cell[col-id=is_working_day] nb-checkbox span.custom-checkbox",
          "before_ms": 800
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-center-cols-container .ag-row[row-index=\"6\"] .ag-cell[col-id=is_working_day] nb-checkbox span.custom-checkbox",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] span:has-text(\"Weekly working hours fund\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] span:has-text(\"Weekly working hours fund\"):has-text(\"30:00\")",
        "url_contains": "/working-hours/setup/"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "narration": "The breaks are on the right. The lunch break from twelve to twelve-thirty doesn't count as working time.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "scroll",
          "value": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-center-cols-container .ag-row[row-index=\"0\"] .ag-cell[col-id=lengthOfHalfShift]",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "scroll",
          "value": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-center-cols-container .ag-row[row-index=\"0\"] .ag-cell[col-id=shift_first_pause_end]",
          "before_ms": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-header-cell[col-id=shift_first_pause_start]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-header-cell[col-id=shift_first_pause_end]",
          "before_ms": 200
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-header-cell[col-id=shift_first_pause_start]",
        "url_contains": "/working-hours/setup/"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "narration": "Sloneek calculates the half-shift length on its own. Half-day absences are based on it.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "scroll",
          "value": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-center-cols-container .ag-row[row-index=\"0\"] .ag-cell[col-id=lengthOfHalfShift]",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-header-cell[col-id=lengthOfHalfShift]",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-header-cell[col-id=lengthOfHalfShift]",
        "url_contains": "/working-hours/setup/"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "narration": "Finally, I save the schedule with the Save button above the table. Without it, the changes wouldn't take effect.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #settings_working_hours_form_weekly_yearly_settings_save_button",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #settings_working_hours_form_weekly_yearly_settings_save_button",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] span:has-text(\"Weekly working hours fund\"):has-text(\"30:00\")",
        "url_contains": "/working-hours/setup/"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "narration": "You assign the template in the user's profile. Under Users, I open Management, search for James, and open his profile.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_staff",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_settings_users",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=tableRow]",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "input[placeholder=\"Search...\"]",
          "value": "James",
          "clear": true,
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Miller James\")",
          "value": "8000"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Miller James\") >> span:text-is(\"Miller James\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] a[href$=\"/contracts-and-terms\"]",
          "value": "15000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-common-header-autocomplete:has-text(\"Miller James\")",
        "url_contains": "/work-data"
      },
      "part": 5,
      "part_title": "Assigning to a user"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "narration": "Here, on the Contract and Payroll tab, you see all of James's work contracts.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] a[href$=\"/contracts-and-terms\"]",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=companyMemberContractsAndTerms] [data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Full-time 40 h\")",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=companyMemberContractsAndTerms] table >> nth=0",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=companyMemberContractsAndTerms] [data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Full-time 40 h\")",
        "url_contains": "/contracts-and-terms"
      },
      "voice_after_actions": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "narration": "James works full-time, forty hours a week, for an indefinite period. The green row marks the work contract that applies today.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=companyMemberContractsAndTerms] [data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Full-time 40 h\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=companyMemberContractsAndTerms] [data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Full-time 40 h\"):has-text(\"Indefinite period\")",
        "url_contains": "/contracts-and-terms"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "narration": "Soon he's moving to part-time. Work contracts can't overlap, so I first end the current one with Edit.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=companyMemberContractsAndTerms] [data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Full-time 40 h\") >> [data-cy=actionsButton]",
          "before_ms": 1500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-context-menu a[title=\"Editing\"]",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=confirmationDialog]",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=confirmationDialog] >> [data-cy=submitButton]",
          "before_ms": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "nb-dialog-container:has(input[formcontrolname=valid_from])",
          "value": "5000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "nb-dialog-container input[formcontrolname=valid_from]",
        "url_contains": "/contracts-and-terms"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "narration": "I untick Indefinite period, enter the last full-time day in Valid until, and confirm the change.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-dialog-container nb-checkbox[formcontrolname=is_indefinite_period] label",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-dialog-container input[formcontrolname=valid_to]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "nb-dialog-container input[formcontrolname=valid_to]",
          "value": "{{DATE:+14d+6:MM/DD/YYYY}}",
          "clear": true,
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-calendar nb-calendar-day-cell.selected",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-dialog-container button:text-is(\"Edit\")",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=companyMemberContractsAndTerms] [data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Full-time 40 h\"):has-text(\"{{DATE:+14d+6:MM/DD/YYYY}}\")",
          "value": "10000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=companyMemberContractsAndTerms] [data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Full-time 40 h\"):has-text(\"{{DATE:+14d+6:MM/DD/YYYY}}\")",
        "url_contains": "/contracts-and-terms"
      }
    },
    {
